making random guesses rarely gets you where you need to be. not saying you cant, but there should be no expectation that it should work without a reason to.
When playing around with JS, its a good habit to have the devtools console open to check for errors. there is no skill variable within that tag, so youd get an error for trying to get the stypeId of undefined. the console would have said it. because of that error, the rest of the notetag wouldnt run.
